Package: ooansi
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: ANSI terminal sequence generator
 A sovereign ANSI terminal sequence generator written in pure openOODA, featuring
 zero ambient authority, 16-color, 256-color, and TrueColor support, and an MCP stdio server.
